{"title": "PM Modi promotes National Handloom Day with social media video call to action", "summary": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi has encouraged citizens to celebrate National Handloom Day on August 7 by showcasing India's handloom heritage. He urged people to share videos on social media featuring their favorite handloom products and to purchase handloom items. The call to action aims to promote the country's rich textile traditions.", "summary_points": ["Prime Minister Narendra Modi urged citizens to celebrate National Handloom Day.", "The celebration is scheduled for August 7.", "He encouraged sharing social media videos featuring favorite handloom products.", "He also urged people to buy handloom products."], "title_hi": "प्रधानमंत्री मोदी ने राष्ट्रीय हथकरघा दिवस मनाने के लिए सोशल मीडिया वीडियो का आह्वान किया", "summary_hi": "प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी ने नागरिकों से 7 अगस्त को राष्ट्रीय हथकरघा दिवस मनाने के लिए भारत की हथकरघा विरासत को प्रदर्शित करने का आग्रह किया है। उन्होंने लोगों से सोशल मीडिया पर अपने पसंदीदा हथकरघा उत्पादों को प्रदर्शित करने वाले वीडियो साझा करने और हथकरघा वस्तुएं खरीदने का आग्रह किया। इस आह्वान का उद्देश्य देश की समृद्ध कपड़ा परंपराओं को बढ़ावा देना है।", "summary_points_hi": ["प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी ने नागरिकों से राष्ट्रीय हथकरघा दिवस मनाने का आग्रह किया।", "यह उत्सव 7 अगस्त को निर्धारित है।", "उन्होंने पसंदीदा हथकरघा उत्पादों को प्रदर्शित करने वाले सोशल मीडिया वीडियो साझा करने के लिए प्रोत्साहित किया।", "उन्होंने लोगों से हथकरघा उत्पाद खरीदने का भी आग्रह किया।"], "framing": {"center": ["Reported Prime Minister Modi's call to celebrate National Handloom Day.", "Highlighted the encouragement for people to buy handloom products.", "Mentioned the specific request for social media videos (GRWM) featuring handloom items."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["राष्ट्रीय हथकरघा दिवस मनाने के लिए प्रधानमंत्री मोदी के आह्वान की सूचना दी।", "हथकरघा उत्पाद खरीदने के लिए लोगों को प्रोत्साहित करने पर प्रकाश डाला।", "हथकरघा वस्तुओं को प्रदर्शित करने वाले सोशल मीडिया वीडियो (GRWM) के विशिष्ट अनुरोध का उल्लेख किया।"]}, "topic": "Society", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://www.livemint.com/lm-img/img/2026/08/06/1600x900/logo/narendra_modi_1786040046458_1786040046589_9f8b62eb-a996-4914-a4c4-e0aec8df763c.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/pm-modi-urges-people-to-celebrate-national-handloom-day-encourages-people-to-make-grwm-videos-11786039865534.html", "headline": "PM Modi urges people to celebrate National Handloom Day, encourages people to make GRWM videos"}, {"source": "The Free Press Journal", "owner": "The Free Press Journal", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "PM Modi Urges People To Buy Handloom Products, Share GRWM Videos Ahead Of National Handloom Day"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/national-handloom-day-2026-history-and-significance-as-pm-modi-marks-12th-celebration-salute-the-skill-creativity-11786073861422.html", "headline": "National Handloom Day 2026: History and significance as PM Modi marks 12th celebration"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/pm-modi-national-handloom-day-buy-handloom-products-share-get-ready-with-me-videos-11876470", "headline": "Buy Handloom Products, Share \"Get Ready With Me\" Videos: PM Modi"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/national-handloom-day-pm-modi-honours-indias-handloom-heritage-on-national-handloom-day-11877788", "headline": "PM Modi Honours India's Handloom Heritage On National Handloom Day"}, {"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "'Our Government 